WEBVTT

00:07:58.224 --> 00:08:02.019
Well, I'm sure Isodope has something
to say about that.

00:08:04.438 --> 00:08:06.398
(Video) (Isodope claps)

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.901
Finally, an argument
that isn't older than me.

00:08:08.943 --> 00:08:10.819
Unfortunately, it still sucks.

00:08:10.819 --> 00:08:14.406
In the '70s, France built
45 reactors in 15 years.

00:08:14.448 --> 00:08:18.369
More recently, Japan, China and Korea
have built reactors in six years or less.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.622
So this means BTS is blow-drying
their hair with clean energy.

00:08:21.664 --> 00:08:23.582
Even if it takes 10 years to build one,

00:08:23.582 --> 00:08:26.418
nuclear power plants can make clean
and reliable electricity

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.711
for at least 80 years.

00:08:28.212 --> 00:08:29.421
This --

00:08:29.463 --> 00:08:33.425
(Applause)